<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: justify; color: #111; }
      h1 { font-size: 16pt; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 12pt; }
      .watermark {
        position: fixed;
        top: 45%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
        font-size: 64pt;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: -1;
      }
      .footer {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 1cm;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 10pt;
        color: #333;
      }
      .section { margin-bottom: 10pt; }
      ol { padding-left: 1.3cm; }
      li { margin-bottom: 8pt; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="watermark">CONFIDENTIAL</div>
    <h1>EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT</h1>

    <div class="section">
      This Employment Contract ("Contract") is entered into on {{start_date}} at {{city}} between:
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Employer:</b> {{employer_name}}
      <br/>
      <b>Employee:</b> {{employee_name}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Designation:</b> {{designation}}
      <br/>
      <b>Department:</b> {{department}}
      <br/>
      <b>Salary:</b> {{salary_figures}} ({{salary_words}})
      <br/>
      <b>Notice Period:</b> {{notice_period_days}} days
    </div>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>Appointment and Role.</b> The employer appoints the employee for the role of {{designation}} in the {{department}} department subject to applicable rules and policies.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Commencement Date.</b> The employment shall commence on {{start_date}}.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Compensation.</b> The employee shall be paid salary of {{salary_figures}} as per payroll terms. Any statutory deductions shall be made as required under applicable Indian law.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Confidentiality.</b> During and after employment, the employee shall not disclose confidential information obtained in the course of work.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Notice Period.</b> Either party may terminate employment by providing {{notice_period_days}} days' prior written notice (or pay in lieu where permitted).
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Probation/Performance Review.</b> The parties may set performance standards and conduct reviews periodically as per internal policies.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Termination for Cause.</b> Either party may terminate the contract for cause in accordance with applicable legal provisions and the terms of this agreement.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Governing Law and Jurisdiction.</b> This Contract shall be governed by the laws applicable in India and subject to competent courts at {{city}}.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Entire Agreement.</b> This Contract represents the entire understanding between the parties and supersedes prior discussions.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div style="margin-top: 18pt;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Employer</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{employer_name}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Employee</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{employee_name}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">This document is generated by NextGenLegal and is legally valid under Indian law</div>
  </body>
</html>

